{"task_id": "Mbpp/439", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef _int_to_decimal_string(n: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Return standard decimal representation of integer n (includes '-' for negatives).\"\"\"\n    return str(n)\n\ndef multiple_to_single(int_list: List[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Concatenate decimal strings of integers in int_list (preserve order) and return as int.\n    If the list is empty, return 0 as per example implementation in design notes.\n    \"\"\"\n    digits = ''.join(_int_to_decimal_string(n) for n in int_list)\n    return int(digits) if digits != '' else 0"}
